---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoFundPassByValueDemo from '../demos/GoFundPassByValueDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gfnd-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Interactive tracer: Go pass-by-value, pointers, and LIFO defer" titleVi="Trình mô phỏng: Truyền tham trị, con trỏ &amp; ngăn xếp defer">
    <GoFundPassByValueDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Step through how stack frames isolate copies, why &amp;x lets *p mutate the original memory cell, and why multiple defers unwind in reverse [3, 2, 1] order.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bấm qua từng bước để thấy rõ bản sao biến nằm ở ô nhớ khác nhau ra sao, cách &amp;x/*p sửa biến gốc và thứ tự đảo ngược [3, 2, 1] của defer khi thoát hàm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gfnd-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gfnd-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gfnd-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gfnd .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr)); }
  .gfnd .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .gfnd .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gfnd .sd-stat b { font-size: 16px; overflow-wrap: anywhere; word-break: break-word; }

  .gfnd-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .gfnd-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gfnd-pane { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); overflow: hidden; }
  .gfnd-hdr {
    padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .gfnd-code { padding: 8px 0; overflow-x: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.55; }
  .gfnd-line { display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 12px; white-space: pre; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gfnd-ln { color: var(--text-muted); user-select: none; min-width: 18px; }
  .gfnd-line.is-active { background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .gfnd-note { padding: 12px; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-body); }
</style>
